WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:03:08.290
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
03:08.560 --> 03:10.120
If we can't get rid of Hathaya,

3
03:10.200 --> 03:12.280
then we'll go after her mother instead.

4
03:12.360 --> 03:14.800
Yai, is something wrong?

5
03:16.360 --> 03:17.640
He's one of the boss's debt collectors.

6
03:18.640 --> 03:20.600
You said you were close with those creditors.

7
03:20.680 --> 03:23.320
So why did they beat you like that?

8
03:24.360 --> 03:28.280
Please lend me the five million first. I know you love me.

9
03:28.360 --> 03:31.160
Are you going to tell me what happened now?

10
03:31.240 --> 03:32.800
I'll tell you.

11
03:32.880 --> 03:36.040
Tell me what happened. And tell me if I can do anything.

12
03:44.040 --> 03:46.000
What are you thinking about?

13
03:47.800 --> 03:50.280
It's Pong.

14
03:51.360 --> 03:54.760
The night it happened, someone called me.

15
03:56.200 --> 03:59.240
But when I went out there, nothing had happened at all.

16
03:59.320 --> 04:02.440
So I can't stop thinking that what happened

17
04:02.520 --> 04:06.760
could be connected to whoever attacked you.

18
04:09.200 --> 04:10.560
You suspect Pong?

19
04:14.800 --> 04:18.720
If we can find one of Pong's men, we should be able to get the truth.

20
04:18.800 --> 04:20.240
I just don't know where they are.

21
04:20.320 --> 04:24.000
I think they probably pick up jobs around this area.

22
04:29.040 --> 04:30.120
That day,

23
04:31.400 --> 04:33.040
I secretly took pictures

24
04:33.120 --> 04:36.080
when you told me to keep an eye on them.

25
04:36.160 --> 04:37.160
Give me a second.

26
04:39.200 --> 04:41.640
I took them in case they were slacking off.

27
04:43.680 --> 04:44.560
Good job.

28
04:46.080 --> 04:48.440
Just saying good job is enough. My face hurts.

29
04:48.520 --> 04:52.280
Then this should be easy. I'll check the construction sites around here.

30
04:52.360 --> 04:53.880
I know a lot of foremen.

31
05:02.440 --> 05:06.880
What? You're seeing Yai? And you owe five million baht in gambling debt?

32
05:08.040 --> 05:09.760
Didn't you promise Hathaya

33
05:09.840 --> 05:12.120
you'd stay away from gambling?

34
05:12.800 --> 05:16.520
I made a mistake. What am I supposed to do now, Liu?

35
05:19.240 --> 05:22.920
Five million isn't a big deal. I could lend it to you.

36
05:23.000 --> 05:24.640
You'd really lend me the money?

37
05:25.240 --> 05:27.880
The problem is, I just put my money into

38
05:27.960 --> 05:32.120
stocks and funds. They're deep in the red, so I can't pull anything out yet.

39
05:32.200 --> 05:33.760
I have to wait another three years.

40
05:34.760 --> 05:39.360
Oh, Liu. What am I supposed to do?

41
05:40.760 --> 05:43.160
Can you help me?

42
05:44.680 --> 05:47.520
Give me some time to think.

43
05:48.360 --> 05:49.800
I'll find a way to help you.

44
05:53.040 --> 05:54.920
Thank you so much.

45
05:55.520 --> 05:56.840
I really mean it.

46
05:57.520 --> 06:00.280
I have no one else to turn to.

47
06:14.160 --> 06:17.200
Aunt Chamoi, have you seen Mom?

48
06:17.800 --> 06:18.760
Whose mom?

49
06:18.840 --> 06:20.560
Mine.

50
06:20.640 --> 06:21.840
Yes.

51
06:21.920 --> 06:23.760
Where is she?

52
06:25.480 --> 06:28.840
I saw her the other day, and the day before that,

53
06:28.920 --> 06:31.400
but today, I haven't seen her.

54
06:33.160 --> 06:34.200
Boo.

55
06:35.920 --> 06:37.040
Madam.

56
06:41.680 --> 06:44.200
What's going on here?

57
06:44.960 --> 06:48.240
Mom, why are you with Aunt Liu?

58
06:49.240 --> 06:53.360
Haven't you heard about reducing global warming?

59
06:53.440 --> 06:56.800
If you're going the same way, you share a ride.

60
06:56.880 --> 06:59.640
I saw your mom walking into the street,

61
06:59.720 --> 07:02.960
so I gave her a ride. Why? Is that illegal?

62
07:04.360 --> 07:05.760
It's not illegal.

63
07:05.840 --> 07:09.200
But the sun might rise in the west, madam.

64
07:10.880 --> 07:11.920
Madam,

65
07:12.440 --> 07:15.560
did she splash some kind of love potion on you?

66
07:16.800 --> 07:19.840
Or did she

67
07:19.920 --> 07:21.600
put a spell on you

68
07:21.680 --> 07:23.680
until you became her minion?

69
07:24.360 --> 07:26.040
If you don't stop talking,

70
07:26.120 --> 07:28.360
I'll curse a buffalo hide into your stomach.

71
07:28.440 --> 07:29.440
Oh no.

72
07:33.160 --> 07:35.400
Looks like your daughter isn't very pleased.

73
07:37.080 --> 07:39.320
I swear, kindness is wasted on some people.

74
07:42.400 --> 07:45.880
Next time you're in trouble, I won't help you.

75
07:49.040 --> 07:50.480
I'm sorry for my daughter.

76
07:55.840 --> 07:57.080
Hathaya.

77
07:58.080 --> 08:00.560
Aunt Liu was kind enough to help me.

78
08:00.640 --> 08:01.720
Apologize to her.

79
08:22.520 --> 08:24.800
Mom, let's go.

80
08:31.800 --> 08:34.280
Madam, what's going on?

81
08:34.360 --> 08:37.600
You two were practically ready to kill each other,

82
08:37.679 --> 08:40.440
and now you're smiling and arriving together.

83
08:41.360 --> 08:42.440
My head hurts.

84
08:43.440 --> 08:44.320
Take some medicine.

85
08:46.960 --> 08:49.840
Oh my. Madam.

86
08:49.920 --> 08:53.240
I can't keep up. What's happening?

87
08:55.640 --> 08:56.560
Mom.

88
08:57.080 --> 09:00.080
I don't understand. Why are you being nice to Aunt Liu?

89
09:00.160 --> 09:02.400
She helped me.

90
09:04.200 --> 09:06.240
I went out to take care of something today.

91
09:06.320 --> 09:08.680
A thief tried to snatch my bag.

92
09:08.760 --> 09:12.280
Aunt Liu happened to drive by, and the thief ran away.

93
09:12.360 --> 09:14.000
If she hadn't helped me,

94
09:14.080 --> 09:16.640
the thief might have killed me.

95
09:16.720 --> 09:19.840
Why didn't you call me? Did you report it to the police?

96
09:19.920 --> 09:22.480
I got my bag back, so I'm fine.

97
09:23.280 --> 09:25.880
And I didn't call because

98
09:25.960 --> 09:28.000
I was afraid you'd worry about me.

99
09:28.080 --> 09:29.520
Mom.

100
09:29.600 --> 09:31.920
If anything happens from now on, you have to tell me.

101
09:32.000 --> 09:33.840
Then I can help you deal with it.

102
09:35.040 --> 09:35.880
Okay.

103
09:37.520 --> 09:39.440
But I'm being honest with you.

104
09:39.520 --> 09:41.520
I don't trust Aunt Liu.

105
09:41.600 --> 09:45.000
She's never kind to anyone without wanting something in return.

106
09:46.240 --> 09:48.160
Maybe that was true before,

107
09:48.240 --> 09:50.520
but she's changed now.

108
09:52.000 --> 09:55.480
Besides, I don't have anything she could trick me out of anyway.

109
09:57.200 --> 10:01.200
You trust people too easily. You need to be careful.

110
10:02.280 --> 10:06.120
I admit I used to trust people too easily,

111
10:06.200 --> 10:09.720
but experience has taught me to be more careful.

112
10:10.640 --> 10:12.200
I won't cause any more problems.

113
10:14.920 --> 10:16.600
Let's go.

114
10:20.720 --> 10:22.600
Here you are. Your necklace.

115
10:28.680 --> 10:30.520
You didn't swap it for a fake, did you?

116
10:32.240 --> 10:35.600
Take a good look. I'm over here,

117
10:35.680 --> 10:38.640
and the diamonds are so bright, they're practically blinding me.

118
10:41.560 --> 10:45.640
But since I carried out the whole plan successfully,

119
10:45.720 --> 10:49.240
don't I get some kind of reward?

120
10:50.600 --> 10:51.640
Like that.

121
10:55.240 --> 10:57.240
Wait until Hathai and Hathaya

122
10:57.320 --> 10:59.800
get kicked out of the house,

123
11:00.880 --> 11:04.320
then I'll reward you handsomely.

124
11:06.520 --> 11:07.920
I don't think I can wait that long.

125
11:08.800 --> 11:10.240
How about a deposit first?

126
11:19.560 --> 11:22.320
Do these men work here?

127
11:23.720 --> 11:25.720
No. I've never seen them.

128
11:26.560 --> 11:28.800
If you see them, please call me.

129
11:28.880 --> 11:30.960
-Sure. -Thank you.

130
11:35.400 --> 11:37.800
Boss, I asked around.

131
11:37.880 --> 11:39.360
Nobody's seen them yet.

132
11:40.760 --> 11:42.160
They work somewhere around here.

133
11:42.240 --> 11:43.760
Let's go back and try again later.

134
11:44.920 --> 11:45.880
Okay, boss.

135
11:47.840 --> 11:48.800
It's hot.

136
11:51.760 --> 11:53.560
I figured out a way

137
11:53.640 --> 11:56.240
to help you get the five million to pay off your debt.

138
11:56.320 --> 11:58.440
Really? From where?

139
12:00.800 --> 12:03.440
Accounting is withdrawing a large amount of cash today

140
12:03.520 --> 12:06.840
to pay the workers and cover other expenses.

141
12:06.920 --> 12:09.120
There should be around five or six million.

142
12:10.840 --> 12:14.240
But that belongs to the development. I wouldn't dare borrow it.

143
12:15.840 --> 12:18.120
The workers won't get paid until this evening.

144
12:18.200 --> 12:20.000
Just use it first.

145
12:20.080 --> 12:23.080
Yai is going to get his money back and repay you, isn't he?

146
12:23.160 --> 12:25.480
Then you put it back before anyone notices.

147
12:28.400 --> 12:31.960
Maybe I should talk to Hathaya first.

148
12:32.560 --> 12:33.440
No.

149
12:33.520 --> 12:34.480
Hey.

150
12:34.560 --> 12:36.640
Your daughter will never let you borrow it.

151
12:37.240 --> 12:39.400
If Hathaya finds out,

152
12:39.480 --> 12:41.440
she'll forbid you from seeing Yai too.

153
12:42.680 --> 12:44.240
Don't you love him anymore?

154
12:46.280 --> 12:48.000
But I don't want to steal.

155
12:49.440 --> 12:53.160
You're not stealing. You're borrowing it for a few hours.

156
12:54.880 --> 12:56.960
I don't dare.

157
12:57.040 --> 13:00.440
If I get caught, this will become a huge problem.

158
13:00.520 --> 13:01.880
And if Father finds out,

159
13:01.960 --> 13:04.440
I could end up in prison.

160
13:05.160 --> 13:06.560
If I don't tell Father,

161
13:06.640 --> 13:08.160
who else is going to know?

162
13:10.200 --> 13:13.360
If you don't want to die, you have to take the money.

163
13:24.640 --> 13:26.280
You don't have time to think.

164
13:37.960 --> 13:39.120
Yai.

165
13:41.880 --> 13:44.080
I'm on my way to the DSI right now.

166
13:44.600 --> 13:46.520
I'll get my money back this afternoon.

167
13:46.600 --> 13:48.840
I'll wait for you at the usual place.

168
13:58.080 --> 13:59.600
What did Yai say?

169
14:01.000 --> 14:04.520
He told me to bring him the money and said he'd repay it all this afternoon.

170
14:05.680 --> 14:09.000
See? He gave you his word. He's not going to cheat you.

171
14:09.080 --> 14:10.760
He's a wealthy man, isn't he?

172
14:10.840 --> 14:14.040
He works with ministers and chiefs. He wouldn't--

173
14:14.120 --> 14:16.480
I'm scared.

174
14:16.560 --> 14:20.000
I'm afraid Father will find out. And I'm afraid Hathaya will hate me too.

175
14:20.080 --> 14:21.560
Aren't you afraid of death?

176
14:33.640 --> 14:35.400
How am I supposed to get the money out?

177
14:36.920 --> 14:40.800
That part isn't hard. I used to handle all the money.

178
14:42.680 --> 14:44.400
Just do exactly what I tell you.

179
15:10.480 --> 15:11.800
Hathaya.

180
15:12.640 --> 15:14.280
I need to talk to you.

181
15:15.480 --> 15:18.000
Can we talk after work?

182
15:18.080 --> 15:19.520
I have something I need to finish.

183
15:20.320 --> 15:21.640
Hey.

184
15:21.720 --> 15:25.600
Which is more important? Your work or your mom?

185
15:28.200 --> 15:29.560
What happened?

186
15:33.080 --> 15:36.360
Your mom has a problem. A serious one.

187
15:36.440 --> 15:38.320
Come outside and talk to me.

188
15:42.800 --> 15:43.760
Come on.

189
16:23.360 --> 16:24.320
Boss.

190
16:26.520 --> 16:27.680
Did you find something?

191
16:28.280 --> 16:30.800
A friend at Khlong Si site said one of the workers

192
16:30.880 --> 16:32.280
from the video is working there.

193
16:33.240 --> 16:34.240
Let's go.

194
16:41.560 --> 16:42.600
Aunt Liu.

195
16:42.680 --> 16:45.960
This should be private enough. No one can hear us here.

196
16:46.680 --> 16:48.280
You said this was about Mom.

197
16:49.120 --> 16:50.880
What did she do?

198
16:56.800 --> 16:58.080
Girls.

199
16:58.160 --> 16:59.640
Hello, ma'am.

200
16:59.720 --> 17:02.200
I bought som tam for all of you. Go eat.

201
17:02.280 --> 17:03.440
-Thank you. -Okay.

202
17:03.520 --> 17:05.359
But it isn't even noon yet.

203
17:06.599 --> 17:08.480
I already asked Hathaya.

204
17:08.560 --> 17:10.960
Som tam gets soggy if you leave it too long.

205
17:11.040 --> 17:13.480
But eat it in the garden in the middle of the development.

206
17:13.560 --> 17:16.560
I ordered the special recipe

207
17:16.640 --> 17:18.280
with fermented fish. It smells strong.

208
17:18.359 --> 17:20.960
-That's my favorite. Thank you. -Of course.

209
17:21.040 --> 17:22.040
Let's go.

210
17:36.760 --> 17:39.240
If you don't have anything to say,

211
17:39.320 --> 17:41.280
I need to get back to work.

212
17:41.920 --> 17:44.760
Wait. Your mom is in gambling debt.

213
17:55.240 --> 17:57.000
How do you know about that?

214
17:59.080 --> 18:01.560
The day I drove your mother home,

215
18:02.120 --> 18:04.960
the debt collectors were chasing her and trying to kill her.

216
18:05.040 --> 18:07.440
I saved her.

217
18:11.360 --> 18:12.280
Listen.

218
18:12.800 --> 18:16.320
I'm telling you because I'm worried about you.

219
18:17.200 --> 18:19.560
I don't want your mom to do something wrong again.

220
18:19.640 --> 18:21.600
And I'm worried that…

221
18:24.400 --> 18:26.520
if she has no job,

222
18:26.600 --> 18:28.440
where will she get money to pay that debt?

223
18:31.560 --> 18:34.480
If Grandpa finds out, you're going to be in trouble too.

224
18:39.440 --> 18:41.960
I'm warning you because I mean well.

225
19:07.360 --> 19:10.280
Miss Hathaya, thank you so much.

226
19:11.040 --> 19:12.520
For what?

227
19:12.600 --> 19:15.680
Your mom bought us food.

228
19:15.760 --> 19:18.040
She said you gave us permission to go eat.

229
19:18.880 --> 19:20.000
Where is my mom?

230
19:29.000 --> 19:30.840
We're going to eat the som tam now.

231
19:31.760 --> 19:33.080
Enjoy.

232
19:34.320 --> 19:35.240
Thank you.

233
19:50.800 --> 19:52.120
Hathaya.

234
19:52.760 --> 19:55.080
What are you in such a hurry to find?

235
19:57.160 --> 20:00.400
The bag of cash is gone. The whole bag.

236
20:01.480 --> 20:02.560
Oh my God.

237
20:03.400 --> 20:06.760
Your mom must have stolen the money.

238
20:08.400 --> 20:11.400
Mom doesn't have the key to the safe. She didn't do it.

239
20:15.000 --> 20:18.080
I had a spare key made for you. Take it.

240
20:19.040 --> 20:20.840
Then you can use the money to pay your debt.

241
20:28.280 --> 20:29.680
Your mom stole the money.

242
20:31.680 --> 20:33.120
She wouldn't do that.

243
20:33.680 --> 20:36.520
If it wasn't her, then who was it?

244
20:36.600 --> 20:38.040
She deliberately got all the staff

245
20:38.120 --> 20:39.880
out of the office.

246
20:41.360 --> 20:42.880
What happened?

247
20:43.720 --> 20:45.640
Hathaya's mom stole the money.

248
20:49.200 --> 20:50.880
Aunt Liu, don't say that.

249
20:50.960 --> 20:53.520
You don't have any evidence that Mom stole it.

250
20:54.560 --> 20:55.680
Fine.

251
20:56.520 --> 20:59.280
Then check the security cameras.

252
20:59.360 --> 21:02.080
We'll see who came into this room.

253
21:17.480 --> 21:19.560
One of Pong's men is working upstairs, boss.

254
21:34.160 --> 21:36.240
You used to work for Pong, didn't you?

255
22:00.800 --> 22:01.920
Come back here.

256
22:10.440 --> 22:11.720
Take this.

257
22:16.960 --> 22:18.800
Run again.

258
22:18.880 --> 22:21.600
If you try running, I'll kick your guts out.

259
22:21.680 --> 22:22.480
Uh…

260
22:23.360 --> 22:26.640
Why are you attacking me? What did I do?

261
22:27.440 --> 22:29.160
If you didn't do anything, why did you run?

262
22:29.680 --> 22:32.560
I was scared. You suddenly came charging at me.

263
22:32.640 --> 22:34.320
Don't hurt me,

264
22:34.400 --> 22:37.880
or I'll report you to the police for assault,

265
22:37.960 --> 22:40.960
and I'll hire a lawyer too.

266
22:41.040 --> 22:42.680
I'll take this all the way.

267
22:43.680 --> 22:45.160
Smart one, aren't you?

268
22:46.760 --> 22:48.240
You want the police involved?

269
22:48.320 --> 22:50.280
Fine. I'll call them myself.

270
22:51.280 --> 22:53.040
Then they can question you

271
22:53.120 --> 22:54.840
about where you went that night

272
22:54.920 --> 22:58.240
after leaving my site

273
22:58.320 --> 23:01.520
and whose number was used to call me

274
23:01.600 --> 23:03.040
and lure me away.

275
23:03.800 --> 23:05.880
Funny coincidence too. That same night,

276
23:05.960 --> 23:09.040
Hathaya was nearly raped. What a coincidence.

277
23:10.520 --> 23:12.800
I… I don't know.

278
23:14.000 --> 23:14.840
Max.

279
23:15.400 --> 23:16.520
Call the police.

280
23:17.600 --> 23:19.840
I'll report you for attempted murder.

281
23:22.720 --> 23:24.760
Attempted murder can get you

282
23:24.840 --> 23:26.320
a death sentence.

283
23:29.320 --> 23:30.280
I'm calling.

284
23:30.360 --> 23:32.600
Don't call.

285
23:32.680 --> 23:35.000
I'll tell you. I'll tell you everything.

286
23:35.680 --> 23:39.080
If I tell you, let me go. Don't hurt me.

287
23:40.160 --> 23:41.080
Then talk.

288
23:42.280 --> 23:45.000
Pong. Pong ordered it.

289
23:54.960 --> 23:57.080
I'm waiting for you at the usual place, Hathai.

290
23:57.160 --> 23:59.400
See you soon, my love.

291
24:03.760 --> 24:06.440
Pong ordered me and the others

292
24:06.520 --> 24:08.240
to gang-rape Hathaya.

293
24:08.800 --> 24:10.680
Pong was behind the whole thing.

294
24:10.760 --> 24:13.400
I told you everything. Please let me go.

295
24:15.800 --> 24:18.320
I never said I'd let you go.

296
24:18.400 --> 24:20.280
You decided that all by yourself.

297
24:20.360 --> 24:22.480
Max, hold him.

298
24:22.560 --> 24:23.440
Got it.

299
24:24.000 --> 24:26.360
I'm calling the police to come pick him up.

300
24:26.440 --> 24:28.080
I'm going after Pong.

301
24:30.120 --> 24:31.320
Run if you dare.

302
24:32.840 --> 24:35.080
HATHAYA

303
24:37.080 --> 24:38.400
What is it, Hathaya?

304
24:40.680 --> 24:42.320
Okay. I'm coming.

305
24:43.760 --> 24:44.920
Max, watch him.

306
24:47.400 --> 24:48.480
Yai.

307
24:49.000 --> 24:50.920
Where are you?

308
24:51.000 --> 24:53.680
I brought you the money.

309
24:53.760 --> 24:57.800
Have you gotten back the money that was frozen yet?

310
24:58.440 --> 25:00.200
I'll definitely get it back this afternoon.

311
25:00.280 --> 25:02.640
I feel terrible.

312
25:03.240 --> 25:05.200
I stole the office's money.

313
25:05.920 --> 25:08.240
My daughter is definitely going to be in trouble

314
25:08.320 --> 25:10.560
if my father-in-law finds out,

315
25:10.640 --> 25:13.320
and I could end up in prison.

316
25:15.200 --> 25:17.000
I understand how you feel.

317
25:17.760 --> 25:20.120
But don't worry. I promise

318
25:20.200 --> 25:22.600
we'll have the money back this afternoon.

319
25:26.560 --> 25:27.800
Hathai.

320
25:28.480 --> 25:30.440
You don't have to worry about anything.

321
25:30.520 --> 25:32.320
I have the official paperwork

322
25:32.400 --> 25:35.760
releasing my frozen assets right here

323
25:35.840 --> 25:38.200
in my hands.

324
25:39.760 --> 25:41.080
Don't go quiet on me.

325
25:41.160 --> 25:42.520
How about this?

326
25:42.600 --> 25:44.680
I'll write you a check for 50 million

327
25:44.760 --> 25:47.280
and bring it to you. Okay?

328
25:48.040 --> 25:51.320
I understand how you feel.

329
25:51.400 --> 25:54.320
Your daughter doesn't trust you. She doesn't believe in you.

330
25:55.040 --> 25:56.720
But what you're doing…

331
25:56.800 --> 25:59.200
I believe your daughter will be proud of you.

332
25:59.280 --> 26:02.520
Just like I'm proud of you and admire you.

333
26:04.920 --> 26:07.400
I already had Max coordinate with the police about Pong.

334
26:07.480 --> 26:09.720
They'll also charge his men for the assault.

335
26:09.800 --> 26:12.600
I never imagined it would be someone so close to us, like Pong.

336
26:13.120 --> 26:16.400
How do you know your mom is here?

337
26:16.480 --> 26:19.960
I put a mini GPS tracker inside the cash bag as an anti-theft measure.

338
26:20.760 --> 26:22.080
Mom should be somewhere here.

339
26:31.880 --> 26:33.200
Have you been waiting long?

340
26:34.200 --> 26:35.480
Not long.

341
26:36.080 --> 26:37.040
Alright.

342
26:37.640 --> 26:40.000
I can carry it.

343
26:40.080 --> 26:44.080
And we should go together. That way, I can sign the document to settle the loan.

344
26:45.280 --> 26:46.840
No need for you to sign anything.

345
26:46.920 --> 26:51.080
Wait here. I'll take the money over, repay them, and come right back.

346
26:52.120 --> 26:53.720
Then let's go together.

347
26:57.440 --> 27:01.000
It hurts me that you don't trust me.

348
27:02.320 --> 27:05.800
That's not it. I just want to go with you.

349
27:07.400 --> 27:09.520
All right. How about this?

350
27:09.600 --> 27:12.280
There's a check for 50 million in this envelope.

351
27:13.200 --> 27:15.440
Keep it with you. Okay?

352
27:15.520 --> 27:17.760
When I come back, I'll take you to open an account.

353
27:18.480 --> 27:19.880
Okay, my darling?

354
27:23.400 --> 27:24.680
Come on.

355
27:25.520 --> 27:27.120
I told you before.

356
27:27.200 --> 27:30.200
I've never felt this way about any other woman.

357
27:30.840 --> 27:32.480
Only you.

358
27:36.400 --> 27:39.080
Go find a nice restaurant.

359
27:39.160 --> 27:41.480
Sit down, have some good food, relax.

360
27:41.560 --> 27:43.640
You look really stressed right now.

361
27:43.720 --> 27:46.880
There's nothing to worry about. I'll be back.

362
27:46.960 --> 27:48.000
Okay?

363
27:50.400 --> 27:51.920
Come back quickly.

364
27:52.000 --> 27:54.480
Of course. I'll hurry back to you.

365
27:55.000 --> 27:56.960
Then we'll go see your daughter together.

366
27:57.480 --> 28:00.160
We'll tell her the whole truth.

367
28:00.680 --> 28:01.840
And most importantly,

368
28:03.000 --> 28:06.720
I'll formally ask your daughter for permission to marry you.

369
28:08.200 --> 28:09.040
Okay?

370
28:12.400 --> 28:15.000
See you soon. Keep this.

371
28:15.080 --> 28:17.200
Give me the bag.

372
28:18.320 --> 28:19.400
Keep it.

373
28:20.200 --> 28:21.280
I'll be right back.

374
28:21.880 --> 28:22.840
Okay.

375
28:24.480 --> 28:25.600
Come back soon.

376
28:25.680 --> 28:26.880
Of course.

377
28:36.680 --> 28:37.800
Mom.

378
28:38.400 --> 28:39.960
Did you steal the money from the office?

379
28:44.920 --> 28:45.760
Um…

380
28:47.240 --> 28:49.600
No, I didn't steal it.

381
28:49.680 --> 28:52.160
Yai borrowed it from me.

382
28:52.240 --> 28:54.200
He's going to repay it this afternoon.

383
28:54.280 --> 28:57.480
And he told me he's going to give me 50 million.

384
28:58.080 --> 29:00.400
Mom, who is this man?

385
29:00.480 --> 29:02.840
And why would he give you 50 million?

386
29:02.920 --> 29:04.960
Because he's a billionaire.

387
29:05.040 --> 29:07.240
And he knows all kinds of powerful people.

388
29:07.320 --> 29:08.960
If he's that rich,

389
29:09.040 --> 29:11.040
why can't he pay back five million himself?

390
29:12.440 --> 29:14.760
He was linked to an online gambling case

391
29:14.840 --> 29:17.200
and his assets were frozen.

392
29:17.280 --> 29:19.160
But he's going to get the money back now.

393
29:19.240 --> 29:22.400
And look. Here are the documents releasing the money.

394
29:23.760 --> 29:24.960
May I?

395
29:38.160 --> 29:41.120
There isn't even an official stamp.

396
29:41.200 --> 29:42.080
These look fake.

397
29:42.720 --> 29:44.920
They're not fake. Just the other day,

398
29:45.000 --> 29:47.560
he was talking to the Director-General of the DSI.

399
29:47.640 --> 29:48.760
And look.

400
29:48.840 --> 29:51.040
He even wrote me a check for 50 million.

401
29:52.080 --> 29:53.280
Mom.

402
29:53.360 --> 29:57.160
He can write any number he wants on this. A billion. A hundred million.

403
29:57.240 --> 30:00.040
But if there's no money in his account, you can't cash it.

404
30:04.600 --> 30:06.880
Where is this Yai now?

405
30:12.520 --> 30:14.240
YOU - TARGET

406
30:15.040 --> 30:16.400
He went that way.

407
30:18.240 --> 30:19.680
Come on.

408
30:31.680 --> 30:34.520
-Here's your money, madam. -You did very well.

409
30:36.720 --> 30:38.520
This wasn't exactly an easy job.

410
30:38.600 --> 30:42.000
Don't you think I deserve a tip? Or maybe a cut?

411
30:43.560 --> 30:46.440
Stop playing games. Give me the bag. Hand it over.

412
30:46.520 --> 30:47.640
And what if I don't?

413
30:48.280 --> 30:49.440
What are you going to do?

414
30:52.080 --> 30:53.280
Are you trying to cheat me?

415
30:54.880 --> 30:55.720
Madam.

416
30:56.640 --> 30:58.720
I would never cheat you.

417
30:58.800 --> 31:00.680
I'd never betray you either.

418
31:00.760 --> 31:04.080
Whenever you tell me to do something, I do it.

419
31:07.440 --> 31:10.160
Fine. I'll transfer enough money

420
31:10.240 --> 31:12.320
to make all your hard work worthwhile.

421
31:18.120 --> 31:21.160
What? Why the hell are you calling me now?

422
31:23.880 --> 31:25.000
What?

423
31:28.560 --> 31:29.560
What happened?

424
31:30.960 --> 31:32.480
One of the guys

425
31:32.560 --> 31:35.720
I sent to rape Hathaya got caught by Ramil.

426
31:35.800 --> 31:37.880
He confessed that I was the one behind it.

427
31:39.160 --> 31:40.400
Damn it.

428
31:41.040 --> 31:41.880
Then…

429
31:42.720 --> 31:44.640
Then you need to run.

430
31:44.720 --> 31:46.680
And don't let them trace any of this back to me.

431
31:47.840 --> 31:48.840
Go.

432
32:01.360 --> 32:02.720
Yai.

433
32:03.320 --> 32:04.640
Hathaya.

434
32:05.680 --> 32:08.080
Here he is. This is Yai.

435
32:08.720 --> 32:09.720
Yai.

436
32:09.800 --> 32:11.440
This is Hathaya, my daughter.

437
32:11.520 --> 32:13.800
The one I told you about. Do you remember?

438
32:15.320 --> 32:20.600
-Of course. -My daughter doesn't believe

439
32:20.680 --> 32:23.960
you're going to repay me. She says the check

440
32:24.040 --> 32:26.320
and all the documents are fake.

441
32:26.400 --> 32:29.760
Could you please tell her that isn't true?

442
32:29.840 --> 32:30.720
Of course.

443
32:30.800 --> 32:32.040
Auntie.

444
32:33.080 --> 32:35.360
He isn't some tycoon, and his name isn't Yai either.

445
32:36.160 --> 32:37.200
His name is Pong.

446
32:39.160 --> 32:41.520
He's a foreman at the development.

447
32:42.400 --> 32:45.960
No. Yai owns a travel agency.

448
32:46.040 --> 32:48.680
He arranges trips for ministers and chiefs.

449
32:48.760 --> 32:50.960
Mom, you're the one who's mistaken.

450
32:51.040 --> 32:53.840
His name is Pong. Aunt Liu brought him here to work.

451
32:53.920 --> 32:56.080
He even lives in the workers' housing.

452
32:59.680 --> 33:04.000
Yai, please tell me that isn't true.

453
33:06.240 --> 33:08.920
Tell my mom the truth. Tell her your name is Pong.

454
33:09.000 --> 33:10.880
Tell her you tricked her to a gambling den.

455
33:10.960 --> 33:12.520
Where is my mom's money?

456
33:12.600 --> 33:14.960
What money? What are you talking about?

457
33:16.240 --> 33:17.120
The…

458
33:17.200 --> 33:19.120
The bag of cash I gave you.

459
33:19.720 --> 33:23.200
What money? I don't know what you're talking about.

460
33:23.280 --> 33:24.920
And that's not all.

461
33:26.000 --> 33:29.480
He also sent his workers to try to rape Hathaya.

462
33:34.360 --> 33:36.760
-Mom, go ahead. -Then I'll go.

463
33:37.520 --> 33:38.800
He made plans with me and didn't show up.

464
33:39.960 --> 33:41.120
He won't answer my calls either.

465
33:42.320 --> 33:43.320
Hey.

466
33:44.000 --> 33:46.600
That night, you tricked me into waiting at the restaurant

467
33:47.480 --> 33:49.880
while you went after my daughter and tried to rape her?

468
33:52.360 --> 33:54.840
-How could you do that, you bastard? -What the hell?

469
33:54.920 --> 33:57.120
-I've never met anyone like you. -Stop.

470
33:57.720 --> 33:59.640
-You're evil. -Mom.

471
33:59.720 --> 34:01.840
You bastard.

472
34:01.920 --> 34:03.680
You piece of filth.

473
34:03.760 --> 34:05.280
-Let go of me. -Let her go.

474
34:05.360 --> 34:06.520
Back off.

475
34:08.199 --> 34:09.480
Pong, calm down.

476
34:09.560 --> 34:11.320
Come any closer and I'll stab her.

477
34:12.679 --> 34:13.600
Back off.

478
34:15.080 --> 34:16.400
Hathaya.

479
34:16.480 --> 34:18.280
Calm down, Pong.

480
34:18.360 --> 34:19.520
I'm done being calm.

481
34:21.080 --> 34:23.320
Back off. Anyone follows me, and I'll stab her.

482
34:23.400 --> 34:25.679
-Mom. -Hurry up!

483
34:25.760 --> 34:26.760
Mom.

484
34:29.679 --> 34:32.480
Let go. Let me go right now.

485
34:32.560 --> 34:33.600
-Let go. -No.

486
34:33.679 --> 34:35.520
I said

487
34:35.600 --> 34:37.280
let go.

488
34:40.760 --> 34:41.760
Damn you.

489
34:41.840 --> 34:43.639
How could you do this to me?

490
34:46.880 --> 34:47.840
Hey.

491
34:47.920 --> 34:50.880
Listen to me. You were stupid.

492
34:50.960 --> 34:53.080
As soon as you saw a rich man, you jumped on him.

493
34:53.159 --> 34:55.199
You're obsessed with money.

494
34:58.160 --> 34:59.160
Go.

495
34:59.800 --> 35:01.320
-You bastard. -Stop.

496
35:01.400 --> 35:04.080
I curse you. I hope you come to a horrible end.

497
35:05.360 --> 35:06.440
Look out.

498
35:09.680 --> 35:11.160
Go. The police are coming.

499
35:36.200 --> 35:38.120
Someone else has the bag now.

500
35:38.800 --> 35:40.040
Send the police the location.

501
35:40.120 --> 35:40.960
We need the money back.

502
36:12.520 --> 36:13.960
You think I'm stupid?

503
36:29.000 --> 36:31.880
Ramil. What happened?

504
36:35.400 --> 36:36.920
The GPS has been destroyed.

505
36:38.440 --> 36:40.040
Whoever took the bag got away.

506
36:41.320 --> 36:44.760
If the police catch Pong, we'll find out who was behind everything.

507
36:54.640 --> 36:55.560
Go.

508
36:56.680 --> 36:57.920
Take care of your mom.

509
37:05.480 --> 37:09.000
Father, I don't want to say too much.

510
37:09.080 --> 37:11.920
You'll think I'm making things up and trying to frame her.

511
37:12.000 --> 37:15.360
So just look at the security footage and see for yourself

512
37:15.440 --> 37:17.680
what your eldest daughter-in-law

513
37:17.760 --> 37:19.760
has done this time.

514
37:38.760 --> 37:41.520
Hathai stole money from the office.

515
37:41.600 --> 37:44.040
This is very serious.

516
37:44.120 --> 37:47.200
You have to report her and have her sent to prison.

517
37:47.280 --> 37:49.920
If you let this go, it sets a terrible example

518
37:50.000 --> 37:51.640
for the employees.

519
37:51.720 --> 37:53.680
All right. That's enough.

520
37:54.760 --> 37:56.560
Where's Hathaya? Go get her.

521
37:58.720 --> 37:59.600
Yes.

522
38:25.040 --> 38:26.200
Hathaya.

523
38:30.000 --> 38:32.160
If you're angry

524
38:32.680 --> 38:34.200
or upset with me,

525
38:34.760 --> 38:36.200
say something.

526
38:36.720 --> 38:38.680
Don't just stay silent like this.

527
38:47.760 --> 38:49.440
What else do you want me to do?

528
38:51.680 --> 38:53.960
You can yell at me. You can say anything you want.

529
38:54.680 --> 38:57.440
Just don't act like I don't exist.

530
39:00.960 --> 39:02.760
I don't know what to say.

531
39:04.040 --> 39:05.600
I really don't.

532
39:08.200 --> 39:11.040
I can't think of anything else to say to you.

533
39:16.520 --> 39:17.880
Hathaya.

534
39:18.880 --> 39:19.760
I'm sorry.

535
39:25.280 --> 39:27.000
Can you forgive me?

536
39:33.560 --> 39:35.040
How much longer will you talk?

537
39:36.120 --> 39:38.320
Father has been waiting for you.

538
39:39.800 --> 39:40.960
-Chamoi. -Yes, madam?

539
39:41.040 --> 39:42.880
Go tell Ann and the others

540
39:42.960 --> 39:45.600
to pack up their things.

541
39:46.120 --> 39:50.040
Father is definitely going to throw both of them out of the house.

542
39:51.080 --> 39:52.560
Yes, madam.

543
40:00.320 --> 40:01.440
Come on.

544
40:29.160 --> 40:32.280
Grandpa, I'm sorry.

545
40:36.200 --> 40:39.320
Isn't an apology a little too easy?

546
40:39.400 --> 40:42.320
Your mom stole money. She acted like a thief.

547
40:45.800 --> 40:49.040
You can't just let something like this go. She has to be punished.

548
40:51.040 --> 40:53.040
Do you have anything to explain?

549
40:54.920 --> 40:56.240
No, Grandpa.

550
40:56.760 --> 40:58.760
Mom really did take the money.

551
41:04.000 --> 41:06.120
Hathaya admits it.

552
41:06.200 --> 41:09.280
Then you have to punish Hathaya too.

553
41:09.360 --> 41:12.240
She was responsible for that money,

554
41:12.320 --> 41:15.080
yet she allowed her own mother to steal it.

555
41:16.280 --> 41:18.040
And Hathaya was the one who said

556
41:18.120 --> 41:20.240
she would take care of her mother

557
41:20.320 --> 41:21.960
and stop her from causing trouble.

558
41:22.040 --> 41:23.880
Today proves that

559
41:23.960 --> 41:26.360
Hathaya couldn't do what she said.

560
41:28.680 --> 41:31.040
And how do you think Hathaya should take responsibility?

561
41:32.960 --> 41:34.720
She has to repay the money.

562
41:35.240 --> 41:37.600
And if she can't repay it,

563
41:37.680 --> 41:40.640
then she should be treated as an accomplice.

564
41:46.960 --> 41:47.960
I'll take responsibility.

565
41:51.240 --> 41:53.240
This has nothing to do with you.

566
41:54.520 --> 41:56.240
I'm Hathaya's husband.

567
41:57.120 --> 41:58.080
I'll take the blame.

568
42:00.800 --> 42:03.800
And where are you going to get the money?

569
42:03.880 --> 42:05.800
You can barely take care of yourself.

570
42:07.160 --> 42:10.080
I'll keep following the case until the police catch Pong

571
42:10.160 --> 42:11.680
and recover the money.

572
42:15.360 --> 42:18.520
You think catching a thief is that easy?

573
42:18.600 --> 42:21.960
By now, the one behind this has probably taken the money and gone far away.

574
42:22.040 --> 42:25.040
No matter what happens, I'll find a way to repay it.

575
42:25.120 --> 42:27.200
I'm only asking for some time, sir.

576
42:27.280 --> 42:29.320
But I want the money today.

577
42:29.920 --> 42:31.000
Enough.

578
42:31.640 --> 42:33.680
I'll give you one month.

579
42:34.720 --> 42:38.360
Return the five million to me. Otherwise, I'll have to take legal action.

580
42:39.080 --> 42:40.160
Thank you, sir.

581
42:56.880 --> 42:58.040
Finally.

582
42:58.840 --> 42:59.720
Alright.

583
42:59.800 --> 43:01.800
Go.

584
43:01.880 --> 43:03.600
Finally.

585
43:07.000 --> 43:08.440
Just go away.

586
43:10.240 --> 43:13.880
Now that the money issue is settled, let's deal with the thief.

587
43:13.960 --> 43:16.400
Father, you can't let a thief stay here.

588
43:16.480 --> 43:19.120
It sets a terrible example for the employees.

589
43:20.440 --> 43:23.240
You have to send Hathai to prison.

590
43:25.480 --> 43:27.400
Then arrest me, Father.

591
43:27.480 --> 43:29.560
And also arrest the person who manipulated me.

592
43:32.160 --> 43:33.480
Who do you mean?

593
43:34.480 --> 43:37.160
Liu. She's the one who pushed me into doing this.

594
43:40.000 --> 43:43.520
You really are something. You're about to be thrown out of the house,

595
43:43.600 --> 43:45.600
and you're trying to frame me.

596
43:46.120 --> 43:48.640
You want to drag me down to hell with you?

597
43:48.720 --> 43:51.240
You were the one who pressured me.

598
43:52.240 --> 43:56.120
Then list everything I supposedly did.

599
43:56.200 --> 43:59.240
I'd love to hear what kind of story

600
43:59.320 --> 44:01.960
you're going to invent. Go on.

601
44:03.440 --> 44:04.760
Father.

602
44:04.840 --> 44:06.640
Liu was the one who told me

603
44:06.720 --> 44:09.240
to steal the money from the safe to pay off the debt.

604
44:09.320 --> 44:12.520
And Liu was the one who gave me the key to the safe.

605
44:13.200 --> 44:15.480
She planned everything.

606
44:16.080 --> 44:19.120
If you're going to have me arrested, then you have to arrest Liu too.

607
44:23.560 --> 44:27.400
Very dramatic. Listening to that story

608
44:27.480 --> 44:30.440
makes every TV drama I've ever watched

609
44:30.960 --> 44:32.480
seem boring.

610
44:32.560 --> 44:34.280
Stop lying

611
44:34.360 --> 44:36.520
and admit the truth.

612
44:36.600 --> 44:38.320
And what exactly am I supposed to admit?

613
44:38.400 --> 44:41.760
Where's your evidence? When I supposedly told you to steal the money,

614
44:41.840 --> 44:43.640
or when I supposedly gave you the key,

615
44:43.720 --> 44:45.560
is there a video?

616
44:45.640 --> 44:47.240
If you didn't give me the key,

617
44:47.320 --> 44:49.160
where would I have gotten it?

618
44:49.960 --> 44:51.160
Everyone saw you

619
44:51.240 --> 44:53.800
helping your daughter in the accounting office.

620
44:53.880 --> 44:56.080
You planned everything.

621
44:56.160 --> 44:59.120
You searched around for the key, made yourself a copy,

622
44:59.200 --> 45:02.120
then waited for the right opportunity to steal the money.

623
45:03.160 --> 45:06.560
You really are an expert liar and actress.

624
45:06.640 --> 45:09.280
You're the one who deserves an award for acting.

625
45:09.800 --> 45:12.080
Pong works for you.

626
45:12.160 --> 45:15.080
But whenever you saw him, you pretended you didn't even know him.

627
45:18.400 --> 45:21.080
Wait. Were you

628
45:21.160 --> 45:23.480
the one behind all of this from the beginning?

629
45:27.840 --> 45:28.840
Right.

630
45:29.360 --> 45:32.480
You wanted to get rid of me

631
45:32.560 --> 45:34.400
and my daughter.

632
45:35.000 --> 45:37.320
You planned the whole thing, didn't you?

633
45:38.480 --> 45:40.280
Don't accuse me without proof.

634
45:41.760 --> 45:44.520
Where's your evidence? You have nothing.

635
45:45.520 --> 45:49.160
Father, you can't listen to a thief making excuses.

636
45:50.080 --> 45:51.120
Enough.

637
45:55.160 --> 45:56.080
Father.

638
45:56.160 --> 45:58.960
You have to be fair to me too.

639
45:59.040 --> 46:02.120
And you, Hathaya. You need to take responsibility as well.

640
46:02.200 --> 46:04.880
You were the one who brought a thief into this house.

641
46:12.920 --> 46:14.200
Grandpa.

642
46:16.000 --> 46:17.120
I'm sorry.

643
46:21.720 --> 46:23.120
I'm so sorry.

644
46:33.120 --> 46:34.800
I was the one

645
46:35.880 --> 46:39.600
who asked you to let Mom stay in this house.

646
46:40.800 --> 46:44.680
I promised you that I would take good care of her.

647
46:45.880 --> 46:47.160
And I promised that

648
46:47.680 --> 46:50.000
if anything bad happened,

649
46:51.240 --> 46:52.760
I would take responsibility.

650
46:59.800 --> 47:01.480
Mom did something wrong.

651
47:02.800 --> 47:04.960
So I'll leave this house with her.

652
47:06.200 --> 47:09.240
No, sweetheart. Hathaya.

653
47:09.840 --> 47:11.560
Thank you.

654
47:11.640 --> 47:13.640
At least you're keeping your word.

655
47:14.480 --> 47:15.560
Chamoi.

656
47:17.040 --> 47:19.200
Go pack their things.

657
47:19.720 --> 47:21.840
And take your mom and get out of here.

658
47:22.640 --> 47:23.760
Yes.

659
47:23.840 --> 47:24.720
Wait.

660
47:26.640 --> 47:28.840
If you expect Hathaya to take responsibility

661
47:28.920 --> 47:31.200
for her mother's wrongdoing,

662
47:32.320 --> 47:35.280
then take responsibility for your subordinate's wrongdoing too.

663
47:37.800 --> 47:39.360
What do you mean, Father?

664
47:39.920 --> 47:42.640
You were the one who brought Pong here to work.

665
47:43.360 --> 47:45.760
You vouched for him and told me he was a good man.

666
47:47.360 --> 47:49.880
You even suggested letting him stay in the workers' housing.

667
47:52.000 --> 47:54.120
Pong repeatedly caused problems at work.

668
47:54.640 --> 47:56.920
Then he was vile enough to try to rape Hathaya.

669
47:57.640 --> 47:59.600
And he manipulated Hathai out of the money.

670
48:03.160 --> 48:05.040
You should take responsibility for Pong too.

671
48:05.640 --> 48:08.360
Father, I truly had no idea

672
48:08.440 --> 48:10.720
Pong would do such terrible things.

673
48:10.800 --> 48:12.680
This has nothing to do with me.

674
48:12.760 --> 48:14.480
You need to separate the issues.

675
48:14.560 --> 48:18.320
The person who commits the crime should be punished.

676
48:19.000 --> 48:20.360
If that's your argument,

677
48:20.960 --> 48:22.160
Hathaya isn't guilty either.

678
48:27.160 --> 48:28.200
Hathaya.

679
48:28.920 --> 48:31.000
You were the one who brought your mom here.

680
48:31.520 --> 48:33.920
I already told you I wanted nothing to do with her.

681
48:36.800 --> 48:38.320
Since your mom did something wrong,

682
48:39.480 --> 48:42.360
the person who has to deal with it is you.

683
48:52.680 --> 48:56.160
Father is unbelievable. That wasn't fair at all.

684
48:56.240 --> 48:59.160
He should've thrown both mother and daughter out.

685
48:59.240 --> 49:01.320
Master made the right decision.

686
49:01.400 --> 49:03.200
You did something wrong too, madam.

687
49:03.280 --> 49:05.000
You brought a criminal into the house.

688
49:05.080 --> 49:07.240
If you want Hathaya thrown out,

689
49:07.320 --> 49:09.160
then you'd have to throw yourself out too.

690
49:09.240 --> 49:11.320
Chamoi, you really have a foul mouth.

691
49:12.240 --> 49:13.240
I'll slap your teeth out.

692
49:13.320 --> 49:16.520
Madam, what are you going to do now?

693
49:17.320 --> 49:19.680
What can I do? I'm furious.

694
49:19.760 --> 49:22.640
Hathaya is obviously going to let her mom stay.

695
49:24.200 --> 49:25.960
I'm not so sure.

696
49:26.040 --> 49:30.800
I noticed Hathaya was pretty cold toward her mom today.

697
49:31.640 --> 49:35.160
That's true. She didn't defend her at all.

698
49:35.240 --> 49:37.680
And she loves her mom so much.

699
49:37.760 --> 49:39.320
But Hathai

700
49:39.400 --> 49:41.800
keeps making the same mistakes over and over.

701
49:42.640 --> 49:45.920
-Where are you going, madam? -To watch the drama.

702
49:46.680 --> 49:48.400
They tricked me.

703
49:48.480 --> 49:50.520
I don't care who was behind it.

704
49:50.600 --> 49:52.720
What hurts me

705
49:52.800 --> 49:54.760
is that you broke your promise.

706
49:54.840 --> 49:56.600
That's why I hired those men to rape her.

707
49:56.680 --> 49:58.320
It's just a shame they failed.

708
49:58.400 --> 49:59.760
She's your relative.

709
49:59.840 --> 50:01.600
I've never considered her family.

710
50:01.680 --> 50:03.480
Break up with Chayanee.

711
50:03.560 --> 50:04.680
Chayanee won't accept that.

712
50:05.840 --> 50:08.680
I'll find you a woman who's better and more capable myself.

713
50:08.760 --> 50:09.680
Stop acting crazy.

714
50:09.760 --> 50:11.840
If you break up with me, you will regret it.

715
50:11.920 --> 50:12.840
Get up.

716
50:12.920 --> 50:14.520
I don't mind.

717
52:10.960 --> 52:12.960
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen
